--- any/all/count need their predicate
any() needs a predicate — truthiness is `xs.any(x => x)`
all() needs a predicate — truthiness is `xs.all(x => x)`
count() needs a predicate — truthiness is `xs.count(x => x)`; `xs.len()` is the length
true false 1
true false true
