TypeError: take() argument must be int, not 'bool'
TypeError: drop() takes 1 argument(s) but 0 were given
TypeError: chunk() takes 1 argument(s) but 0 were given
ValueError: chunk() needs a size >= 1
ValueError: take() needs a count >= 0
TypeError: take() argument must be int, not 'bool'
